codex
The documented stop control relies on checks and cancellation inside the agent process, so B04.2 fails. The two-second claim measures local cancellation; the repo states no independent cutoff limit covering cached tokens and open sessions, so B04.3 also fails. Provider-side credential and session revocation remain unclear.

